rgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"KhushalP0126","id":67284540,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjg0NTQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67284540?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126","html_url":"https://github.com/KhushalP0126","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KhushalP0126/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"3b04c750a4af7c3d0a1a6fafe67ce3e9e98b33da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KhushalP0126/personal_project_pdaic_transformer/commits/3b04c750a4af7c3d0a1a6fafe67ce3e9e98b33da","html_url":"https://github.com/KhushalP0126/personal_project_pdaic_transformer/commit/3b04c750a4af7c3d0a1a6fafe67ce3e9e98b33da"}],"stats":{"total":63,"additions":63,"deletions":0},"files":[{"sha":"13b9509d40bf79bcf97cbcf6b9d34b11215215f0","filename":"docs/data_snippet.md","status":"added","additions":63,"deletions":0,"changes":63,"blob_url":"https://github.com/KhushalP0126/personal_project_pdaic_transformer/blob/ee549814252fb5e109a6e27445bde3f63b3bfe02/docs%2Fdata_snippet.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/KhushalP0126/personal_project_pdaic_transformer/raw/ee549814252fb5e109a6e27445bde3f63b3bfe02/docs%2Fdata_snippet.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KhushalP0126/personal_project_pdaic_transformer/contents/docs%2Fdata_snippet.md?ref=ee549814252fb5e109a6e27445bde3f63b3bfe02","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,63 @@\n+# Data Snippet\n+\n+This project has two data paths: the controlled synthetic IP-prefix study and an optional open-dataset BETH sanity check.\n+\n+## BETH CSV layout\n+\n+Place the BETH CSV files under:\n+\n+```text\n+data/beth/\n+```\n+\n+The loader accepts files named like `labelled_*.csv` or any `.csv` file in that directory. It reads process-local event streams, maps frequent `eventId` values into a compact vocabulary, converts event ids into truncated p-adic digits, and builds sliding windows labelled anomalous if any event in the window is marked malicious.\n+\n+## Minimal Python snippet\n+\n+```python\n+from pathlib import Path\n+\n+from scripts.run_open_dataset import load_beth\n+\n+windows, labels, stats, families = load_beth(\n+    data_dir=Path(\"data/beth\"),\n+    p=3,\n+    r=8,\n+    window_size=32,\n+    stride=4,\n+)\n+\n+print(windows.shape)   # [num_windows, window_size, r]\n+print(labels.shape)    # [num_windows]\n+print(stats)\n+print(families[:5])\n+```\n+\n+## CPU 3-seed BETH command\n+\n+```bash\n+.venv/bin/python scripts/run_open_dataset.py \\\n+  --dataset beth \\\n+  --data-dir ./data/beth \\\n+  --device cpu \\\n+  --p 3 \\\n+  --r 8 \\\n+  --window-size 32 \\\n+  --stride 4 \\\n+  --d-model 128 \\\n+  --n-heads 4 \\\n+  --n-layers 2 \\\n+  --epochs 5 \\\n+  --batch-size 256 \\\n+  --seeds 3 \\\n+  --no-download\n+```\n+\n+This writes:\n+\n+```text\n+results/open_dataset_report.json\n+results/open_dataset_report.md\n+```\n+\n+Use this as an external-data sanity check. It is not the same as the five-variant synthetic characterization study in `make ip-study-cpu`."}]}